<title>UK: Mexico adds $500 million to January 2007 bond.</title>
<headline>Mexico adds $500 million to January 2007 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico has added $500 million to its 9.875 percent bond due January 15, 2007, lead manager Salomon Brothers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The new paper has a 105.639 issue price.</p>
<p>The global bond was launched as a $1.0 billion offering on</p>
<p>January 8 this year.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  COUPON     9.875     MATURITY    15.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  105.639   PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  BA2/BB    DENOMS (K) 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  MEXICO</p>
